WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.500
09:00 — Shelf on phone. Ali opens the collection on his phone while a box sits on the bed — finally matching what he owns to what he remembers owning.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:17.000
11:00 — Detail photos. A quick phone photo attaches to a pair’s detail page so the shelf and the under-bed storage stop arguing.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:25.500
15:00 — iPad shelf map. Wider shelf map on the iPad shows gaps and doubles; he laughs at two identical colourways he swore were unique.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:34.000
20:00 — Wishlist laptop. Laptop wishlist before payday — wants, not cart panic — with notes on size and why he wants them.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:42.500
21:00 — Stats glance. Laptop stats show fictional counts only; he closes the lid knowing the shelf finally matches the boxes.

